4. SAFETY-CRITICAL USE
The Work concerns gender-based violence (GBV) and the safety of vulnerable
people, including children. It is a portfolio demonstration and has NOT
undergone legal, child-protection, privacy (POPIA) or independent security
review. It must not be relied on as, or deployed as, a real reporting,
safeguarding or emergency service. It is not a substitute for the police,
emergency services, healthcare providers or trained support organisations.
In an emergency, contact the South African Police Service (10111), emergency
services (112), or another appropriate service.

Any real-world deployment requires the Owner's written permission AND prior
professional legal review (including POPIA and the Children's Act), a
security audit, and verification of all emergency and support-service
information.

